# the same functions with Folding withheld: the scan asks nothing of constants, Link lists no key, and the accesses go by the values of their keys
# where Link lists no key, TypedOperations reads a key that is one written text off the body by itself (keyOfKnownTextThatAccessGoesBy()), so in the walk that is withheld too
# RUN: walk f1 f2 mechanisms=-Folding-TypedOperations
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = ElemGet
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: ElemSet
# RUN(LINK): link accesses mechanisms=-Folding
# LINK-NOT: under "kind"
# RUN(NONE): walk f1 mechanisms=none
# NONE: = ElemGet
# PROGRAM-OF: ../../link/key-made-of-constants-is-a-name.ir
